<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head><meta charset="UTF-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>代号柒 · 全幅卡面轻装饰提案</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/card-rarity-preview.css"><link rel="stylesheet" href="./css/rarity-design-lab.css"></head>
<body>
<header class="masthead"><a href="#"><span class="brand">柒</span> 代号柒 <span>/</span> CARD STUDY</a><span>全包边框 · 08</span></header>
<main>
<section class="intro"><div><p class="eyebrow">FULL ART / 全包边框</p><h1>全幅画面，包进有厚度的边框。</h1><p>四边连贯、向外扩出。用框厚、倒角与镶嵌，让五档一眼可辨。</p></div><div class="scope-note">费用 · 宝石标签 · 卡名 · 效果<br><strong>沿用现行位置</strong></div></section>
<section class="workspace" aria-label="轻装饰设计样本">
<div class="toolbar"><div class="design-tabs" role="group" aria-label="装饰风格"><button data-design="orbit" aria-pressed="false">A 星轨</button><button data-design="ink" aria-pressed="false">B 银墨</button><button data-design="frost" aria-pressed="false">C 霜枝</button><button data-design="blade" aria-pressed="false">D 刀铭</button><button data-design="rose" aria-pressed="false">E 蔷薇</button></div><div class="view-controls"><button id="compare" aria-pressed="true">五版并排</button><button id="decoration" aria-pressed="true">装饰：开</button><button id="gray" aria-pressed="false">灰度</button><button id="compact" aria-pressed="false">手牌尺寸</button></div></div>
<div class="revision-bar"><div role="group" aria-label="版本对比"><button data-revision="8" aria-pressed="true">外扩包框</button><button data-revision="7" aria-pressed="false">薄边精修</button><button data-revision="6" aria-pressed="false">原银墨</button></div><p id="revision-note">四边闭合 · 向外扩出 · 倒角与侧面厚度</p></div>
<div class="exhibit-caption"><div><h2 id="scheme-title">同图同档 · 五种装饰</h2><p id="scheme-description">新增装饰集中在角部和边沿，原画仍占据完整卡面。</p></div><div class="selects"><label>原画 <select id="art"><option value="0">青龙化身</option><option value="1">恶魔之力</option><option value="2">霜月斩</option></select></label><label id="compare-label">档位 <select id="compare-tier"><option value="0">古朴</option><option value="1">稀有</option><option value="2">史诗</option><option value="3" selected>传说</option><option value="4">棱彩</option></select></label></div></div>
<div id="cards" class="card-grid"></div><div class="exhibit-foot"><p id="sample-note" aria-live="polite"></p><span>关闭装饰，查看原版</span></div>
</section>
<section class="notes"><p><strong>怎么比较</strong> “外扩包框 / 薄边精修 / 原银墨”使用相同原画与文案；点击卡面放大，或切换灰度与手牌尺寸。</p><p>边框在画面外侧增加体积。古朴素框、稀有斜面、史诗双层、传说雕框、棱彩晶体镶嵌；五种主题各用自己的纹章。</p></section>
<details class="references"><summary>这轮参考了什么</summary><div class="reference-grid"><a href="https://hearthstone.blizzard.com/en-us/news/23934449" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img loading="lazy" src="https://bnetcmsus-a.akamaihd.net/cms/gallery/3n/3NQLFNXFVFSS1680041050172.png" alt="炉石官方异画薄框示例"><strong>炉石 · 异画</strong><span>借鉴：角件与边沿连成整体，让全幅画面占主位。</span></a><a href="https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/feature/collecting-wilds-of-eldraine" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer"><img loading="lazy" src="https://media.wizards.com/2023/images/daily/en_cb7ed319b8.png" alt="万智牌官方 Rhystic Study 展示框"><strong>万智牌 · 童话展示框</strong><span>借鉴：同一种主题贯穿边框，纹样有连续的节奏。</span></a><a href="./card-design-references/"><img loading="lazy" src="./card-design-references/images/lor-garen.png" alt="符文之地传说 Garen 卡面"><strong>符文之地传说 · 单位卡</strong><span>借鉴：深色凹槽、金属亮面与镶座的前后层次。</span></a></div></details>
<footer>第八稿蔷薇包框已接入游戏 · 其他主题与旧稿保留作外观对照</footer>
</main>
<dialog id="detail" aria-labelledby="detail-title"><div class="dialog-head"><h2 id="detail-title"></h2><button id="close" aria-label="关闭放大">关闭 ×</button></div><div id="detail-card"></div><p id="detail-note"></p></dialog>
<script type="module" src="./src/rarity-design-lab.js"></script>
</body></html>
